    <summary>A CLI for evaluating agent workflows, skills, and custom agents.</summary>
    <description>Waza is a Go CLI for evaluating **agent workflows, skills and custom agents**. Define repository, CLI or MCP scenarios in YAML, run graded trials and inspect the recorded evidence. Existing skill suites remain supported.

Perfect for skill authors, platform teams, and developers building AI-powered applications.
